sting stores. There can be no assurance that the number of stores that we actually open in fiscal 2026 will not be different from the number of stores we plan to open, or that actual fiscal 2026 capital expenditures will not differ from our expectations.","context":"Our capital requirements include construction and fixture costs related to the opening of new stores, remodel and relocation expenditures for existing stores. Future capital requirements will depend on many factors, including the pace of new store openings, the availability of suitable locations for new stores and the nature of arrangements negotiated with landlords. Our net investment to open a new store has varied significantly in the past due to a number of factors, including the geographic location and size of the new store, and is likely to vary significantly in the future.","section":"Results of Operations","block":250,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001193125-26-387835","form":"10-Q","filedAt":"2026-09-10","reportDate":"2026-08-01","cik":"0001318008","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1318008/000119312526387835/zumz-20260801.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/c17f5cb5f0949c01d1842494851d06f0baec1fe725b372ff9404bbb90fa364d0.bin","sha256":"c17f5cb5f0949c01d1842494851d06f0baec1fe725b372ff9404bbb90fa364d0"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0}},"warnings":["managementExplanations: evidence cap reached."]},{"version":1,"source":null,"layers":{"businessProfile":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"operatingKpis":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"managementExplanations":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"materialEvents":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"segmentIntelligence":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omitted